Z||000012||FieroLisa||07-16-2001||02:34 PM||||My cat clogged up on the way to Michigan this weekend,... for about 100 miles I couldn't get over 50 mph.  But I got it home and just replaced it with an auto zone universal cat... obviously it fixed the problem right up, not too expensive. I'm going to straight pipe it one of these days though, but I needed it fixed so that I could get to the show!<P>That catalyst crap was completely dust except for one softball sized chunk in my old cat. Now there are pieces of it left in my exhaust still.<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT: 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air intake<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/fierolisa.gif"> ||||reg||1
